pleted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.6.beta3.official [76dda5c6c]\n- NOT reproducible in v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.beta3 - macOS Sequoia (15.7.3) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe debanding logic was re-written with the changes to HDR 2D behaviour. This introduced a problem where no debanding is applied with Forward+, HDR 2D disabled, and spatial scaling active:\n\nGodot version | Debanding disabled | Debanding enabled\n--|--|--\nGodot 4.5.1 | <img width=\"697\" height=\"499\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ced196f7-b58c-45b9-8cc6-f1bce4a9f651\" /> | <img width=\"697\" height=\"499\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3997262-84d9-4eaf-8573-40c1bce0e6a8\" />\nGodot 4.6 Beta 3 | <img width=\"696\" height=\"572\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b246ac34-6c84-4270-86ff-94f9f77b2beb\" /> | <img width=\"696\" height=\"572\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c63ad19c-6538-43d3-9380-dcdca355e48d\" />\n\nI will post a PR very soon that fixes this issue.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a project with Forward+ and HDR 2D disabled\n- Enable some sort of spatial scaling like FSR 1.0 or MetalFX (Spatial)\n- Note that debanding doesn't work\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[spatial-material-debanding.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24567696/spatial-material-debanding.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114889/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114889/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}